{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203430","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203430","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1320343001:1":{"text":"等一等！柳博米尔，你不能就这样离开。","source_cn":"等一等！柳博米尔，你不能就这样离开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB316FD35A130F91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320343002:1":{"text":"列夫斯基的家人还需要你的帮助！","source_cn":"列夫斯基的家人还需要你的帮助！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDB9F0FBC4520E2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320343003:1":{"text":"你们看得出来，我不想帮他这个忙。","source_cn":"你们看得出来，我不想帮他这个忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F6A05C961147B63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1320343003":{"text":"你们看得出来，我不想帮他这个忙。","source_cn":"你们看得出来，我不想帮他这个忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F6A05C961147B63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320343005:1":{"text":"……你们知道吗？从柳博米尔死亡的那一天开始，我就不再是那个人了。","source_cn":"……你们知道吗？从柳博米尔死亡的那一天开始，我就不再是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF1894408EB0AF2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320343006:1":{"text":"诶……？为什么又突然说到你自己身上？","source_cn":"诶……？为什么又突然说到你自己身上？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF68C3AB7D94C694A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320343007:1":{"text":"因为我比任何人都清楚。消逝的生命无法补全，即使死而复生，复活的也不再是从前的那个人了。","source_cn":"因为我比任何人都清楚。消逝的生命无法补全，即使死而复生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63B9267491724F7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320343008:1":{"text":"当生命的本质发生了变化……我也只是一个，顶着“柳博米尔”这个名字的亡灵。","source_cn":"当生命的本质发生了变化……我也只是一个，顶着“柳博米尔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x336DB14C70926E75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320343009:1":{"text":"同样的，未完成的画作如果被他人补完，也会失去原本的艺术价值……还有独一无二的意义。","source_cn":"同样的，未完成的画作如果被他人补完，也会失去原本的艺术...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B14BE5EFD94B411","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320343010:1":{"text":"生命和死亡、完美和残缺都各有意义，但永远无法缝合在一起。\n……也不应该缝合在一起。","source_cn":"生命和死亡、完美和残缺都各有意义，但永远无法缝合在一起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9D61F1A01746BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1320343010":{"text":"生命和死亡、完美和残缺都各有意义，但永远无法缝合在一起。\n……也不应该缝合在一起。","source_cn":"生命和死亡、完美和残缺都各有意义，但永远无法缝合在一起。\\n……也不应该缝合在一起。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9D61F1A01746BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320343011:1":{"text":"……什么意思？","source_cn":"……什么意思？<key:dialog2>","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23225DA2405E5809","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"……什么意思？","female":"……什么意思？","variant_male_record_index":"144531","variant_female_record_index":"144532","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320343012:1":{"text":"梅林的意思是，我们只认识你这位亡灵“柳博米尔”，这说明你可以拥有和人类“柳博米尔”不一样的生活！","source_cn":"梅林的意思是，我们只认识你这位亡灵“柳博米尔”，这说明...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCA86D4C99B9BDBEB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"梅林的意思是，我们只认识你这位亡灵“柳博米尔”，这说明你可以拥有和人类“柳博米尔”不一样的生活！","female":"梅林的意思是，我们只认识你这位亡灵“柳博米尔”，这说明你可以拥有和人类“柳博米尔”不一样的生活！","variant_male_record_index":"144533","variant_female_record_index":"144534","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320343013:1":{"text":"换到画作上来说……就是补全后的画作会拥有全新的意义！","source_cn":"换到画作上来说……就是补全后的画作会拥有全新的意义！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3598CAC4273454F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320343014:1":{"text":"或许你说的没错。但新的意义……难道一定会比旧的更好吗？","source_cn":"或许你说的没错。但新的意义……难道一定会比旧的更好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB65D77CC78C3C024","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record